{
    "title": "Lively: Cycle, Period tracker",
    "description": "Meet Lively, the premier app for aligning with your cycle to enhance every day.Personalised daily tips are tailored to your menstrual phase and hormone levels, empowering you to navigate each day with confidence and ease. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf51Our personalized daily tips are tailored to your menstrual phase and hormone levels, empowering you to navigate each day with confidence and ease. Lively offers guidance on nutrition, sports, and self-care, ensuring you feel supported and nurtured throughout your entire cycle.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udc68 Enjoy Lively with your partner using the \"Partner Syncing\" feature. Share cycle phases and moods in a private setting to deepen your connection. This unique app experience keeps you in tune with each other\u2019s needs, enhancing understanding and closeness.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddecUnlike men, who function on a 24-hour cycle, women experience a unique 28-day cycle that influences their mood, energy, and well-being.\r\n\r\nYour menstrual cycle syncing has four dazzling phases, and we\u2019ve got your back through them all:\r\n\r\n<b>MENSTRUAL:</b> Time to shed the uterine lining and start anew! Focus on rest, self-care, and light exercise.\r\n<b>FOLLICULAR:</b> Feel the energy and creativity boost! Let\u2019s set goals, plan, and enjoy nourishing foods.\r\n<b>OVULATORY:</b> Embrace your peak fertility and energy. This is the perfect time for socializing, working out, and maintaining a balanced diet.\r\n<b>LUTEAL:</b> Time to unwind and reflect. Indulge in nurturing activities and satisfy cravings with healthy alternatives.\r\nWith Lively by your side, you\u2019ll stay in sync with your body\u2019s natural rhythm, optimizing your well-being, energy, and mood. We\u2019ll help you make the most of your 28-day cycle and enhance your daily life.\r\n\r\nFrom nourishing your body with the right foods to finding the best exercise routines and practicing self-care, Lively has you covered.\r\nReady to start your journey? Join the Lively community today and let\u2019s begin syncing your cycle to transform your everyday life!\r\n\r\nJoin Cycle Syncing Community:\r\nIG: @livelycycle\r\n\r\nTerms and conditions: https://livelycycle.com/terms-conditions/\r\nPrivacy policy: https://livelycycle.com/privacy/\r\n\r\nSubscription pricing and terms for Lively -  Sync Cycle & Period Tracker App:\r\nPayment will be charged to the credit card connected to your Google Pay when you confirm the initial subscription purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and the cost of the renewal will be identified. You may manage your subscription and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your Account Settings after the purchase.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet Lively, the premier app for aligning with your cycle to enhance every day.Personalised daily tips are tailored to your menstrual phase and hormone levels, empowering you to navigate each day with confidence and ease. <br><br>\ud83c\udf51Our personalized daily tips are tailored to your menstrual phase and hormone levels, empowering you to navigate each day with confidence and ease. Lively offers guidance on nutrition, sports, and self-care, ensuring you feel supported and nurtured throughout your entire cycle.<br><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udc68 Enjoy Lively with your partner using the &quot;Partner Syncing&quot; feature. Share cycle phases and moods in a private setting to deepen your connection. This unique app experience keeps you in tune with each other\u2019s needs, enhancing understanding and closeness.<br><br>\ud83e\uddecUnlike men, who function on a 24-hour cycle, women experience a unique 28-day cycle that influences their mood, energy, and well-being.<br><br>Your menstrual cycle syncing has four dazzling phases, and we\u2019ve got your back through them all:<br><br><b>MENSTRUAL:</b> Time to shed the uterine lining and start anew! Focus on rest, self-care, and light exercise.<br><b>FOLLICULAR:</b> Feel the energy and creativity boost! Let\u2019s set goals, plan, and enjoy nourishing foods.<br><b>OVULATORY:</b> Embrace your peak fertility and energy. This is the perfect time for socializing, working out, and maintaining a balanced diet.<br><b>LUTEAL:</b> Time to unwind and reflect. Indulge in nurturing activities and satisfy cravings with healthy alternatives.<br>With Lively by your side, you\u2019ll stay in sync with your body\u2019s natural rhythm, optimizing your well-being, energy, and mood. We\u2019ll help you make the most of your 28-day cycle and enhance your daily life.<br><br>From nourishing your body with the right foods to finding the best exercise routines and practicing self-care, Lively has you covered.<br>Ready to start your journey? Join the Lively community today and let\u2019s begin syncing your cycle to transform your everyday life!<br><br>Join Cycle Syncing Community:<br>IG: @livelycycle<br><br>Terms and conditions: https://livelycycle.com/terms-conditions/<br>Privacy policy: https://livelycycle.com/privacy/<br><br>Subscription pricing and terms for Lively -  Sync Cycle &amp; Period Tracker App:<br>Payment will be charged to the credit card connected to your Google Pay when you confirm the initial subscription purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and the cost of the renewal will be identified. You may manage your subscription and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your Account Settings after the purchase.",
